      "name": "Anna Kowalski",
      "location": "Warsaw, Poland",
      "rating": 5,
      "date": "2025-11-28",
      "title": "Cleans grout without any chemicals — our kitchen looks brand new",
      "body": "After months of trying every cleaner on the market, one round with this steam cleaner and the grout between our kitchen tiles is white again. No chemicals, just water. The 1.5L tank gives about 25 minutes of continuous steam.",
